 processors.\n\nNextLeads does not intentionally store complete payment card numbers, CVV numbers, UPI PINs, banking passwords, or similar payment authentication credentials.\n\nD. Device, Technical and Usage Information\n\nWe may automatically receive limited technical information required for security, troubleshooting, analytics, and operation of the Services, such as:\n\n• Device type\n• Operating system and app version\n• IP address\n• App interactions\n• Crash and diagnostic information\n• Login/session information\n• General usage information\n\nSuch information may be processed for app functionality, security, fraud prevention, diagnostics, performance improvement, and analytics.',
